flowchart LR
  skills["Governed stage skills<br/>[Markdown: stage policy and compact scan]"]:::component
  artifacts["Approved feature and proof artifacts<br/>[Markdown: stable IDs and rows]"]:::container
  compact["Compact core<br/>[Markdown: boundary-first-method-v1.md]"]:::component
  authoring["Feature-authoring guidance<br/>[Markdown: spec families only]"]:::component
  proof["Proof guidance<br/>[Markdown: test-spec families only]"]:::component
  manifest["Resource projection manifest<br/>[YAML: closed resources and consumers]"]:::component
  projector["Projection and validation<br/>[Python: manifest interpreter and parity checks]"]:::component
  selector["Validation selector<br/>[Python: path-owned check routing]"]:::component
  baseline["Reviewed pending revision<br/>[Git identity: authoring input only]"]:::container
  inventory_helper["Inventory derivation helper<br/>[Python function: read-only Git object input to sorted paths or issues]"]:::component
  activation_authoring["Activation authoring<br/>[Reviewed edit: call helper once and freeze input and output]"]:::component
  activation["Activation record<br/>[YAML: pending or active checked-revision snapshot]"]:::component
  checked_validator["Checked-revision validator<br/>[Python: current files only]"]:::component
  routine_release["Routine release workflow<br/>[Profile, preflight, full gate, trusted publication, closeout]"]:::component
  public["GitHub and npm<br/>[External: immutable tag, assets, registry, and public smoke]"]:::external
  generated["Generated, packed, archived, and installed skills<br/>[Derived proof, not Git rollback state]"]:::container
  evidence["Measurement and package evidence<br/>[YAML/Markdown fixtures and reports]"]:::container

  skills -->|package for every governed stage; owner families load initially and downstream stages load on expansion| compact
  skills -->|package and load only for spec and spec-review| authoring
  skills -->|package and load only for test-spec and test-spec-review| proof
  skills -->|consume cited boundary, interaction, and proof rows first from| artifacts
  manifest -->|declares the sole resource-to-consumer matrix for| projector
  compact -->|provides canonical raw bytes to| projector
  authoring -->|provides canonical raw bytes to| projector
  proof -->|provides canonical raw bytes to| projector
  projector -->|writes or checks complete skill-local projections in| skills
  projector -->|proves mapped path and raw-byte identity through| generated
  selector -->|selects purpose-built checks for| skills
  selector -->|retains lifecycle checks for| artifacts
  baseline -->|is supplied explicitly with repository root to| inventory_helper
  inventory_helper -->|returns sorted eligible paths or bounded issues without writes to| activation_authoring
  activation_authoring -->|records baseline provenance and frozen inventory in| activation
  manifest -->|provides current resource identity to| checked_validator
  projector -->|provides current projection identity to| checked_validator
  activation -->|provides one coherent snapshot to| checked_validator
  generated -->|provides adapter support and rollback metadata to| checked_validator
  checked_validator -->|reports checked state and release intent without public claims to| evidence
  activation -->|provides release intent and rollback identity to| routine_release
  generated -->|provides coherent package and archive candidates to| routine_release
  routine_release -->|publishes and then records public evidence from| public
  routine_release -->|records preparation, verification, timing, and closeout in| evidence
  generated -->|produces package and clean-install results recorded in| evidence
  evidence -->|supports review of the authored active snapshot in| activation
  projector -->|records static resource and representative loading baselines in| evidence

